
📌 Customer Churn Analysis & Retention Strategy
📖 Project Overview

Customer retention is one of the most important business challenges in the e-commerce industry. Acquiring a new customer is significantly more expensive than retaining an existing one. This project focuses on identifying the key factors influencing customer churn through exploratory data analysis (EDA), SQL-based business analysis, and customer segmentation.

The objective is to uncover churn patterns, understand customer behavior, identify at-risk customers, and recommend data-driven retention strategies to improve customer loyalty and reduce churn.

🎯 Business Problem

The company observed an increasing customer churn rate but lacked visibility into:

Which customers are most likely to churn
What factors contribute to customer churn
Which customer segments require immediate attention
What business actions can improve customer retention
🎯 Project Objectives
Calculate overall customer churn rate
Analyze customer behavior across different business dimensions
Identify churn drivers using SQL
Validate business hypotheses through EDA
Perform customer segmentation
Conduct root cause analysis
Recommend actionable retention strategies
